    rdfs:comment "Loading sample analytics data populates the prebuilt `Recovery & Readiness` dashboard (`calc.readiness`, `calc.hrv`, `calc.sleep`, `calc.soreness`, `calc.monotony`, `calc.acwr`), aligns `totalVolume` units (`kg`) and 1-decimal table cell precision, suppresses contradictory record counts on empty chart ranges, and provides a confirmed `Delete dashboard` path for user-created dashboards." ;
    qa:hasStep <https://wod.wiki/qa/journey/ANL-05/beat/Seed>, <https://wod.wiki/qa/journey/ANL-05/beat/Enter>, <https://wod.wiki/qa/journey/ANL-05/beat/Sense>, <https://wod.wiki/qa/journey/ANL-05/beat/Drive>, <https://wod.wiki/qa/journey/ANL-05/beat/Prove> .

