    qa:inDomain <https://wod.wiki/qa/domain/journal> ;
    rdfs:comment "The Playground exposes static discovery manifests (`/llms.txt` and `/.well-known/agent-capabilities.json`), DOM hydration and landmark readiness markers (`data-app-hydrated`, `data-agent-status`, `#agent-view-state`), mount-scoped WebMCP tools on `navigator.modelContext`, and Tier 2 human-in-the-loop confirmation modals (`AgentConfirmHost`)." ;
    qa:hasStep <https://wod.wiki/qa/journey/JRN-06/beat/Seed>, <https://wod.wiki/qa/journey/JRN-06/beat/Enter>, <https://wod.wiki/qa/journey/JRN-06/beat/Sense>, <https://wod.wiki/qa/journey/JRN-06/beat/Drive>, <https://wod.wiki/qa/journey/JRN-06/beat/Prove> .

